# --- Monorepo root .gitignore ---

### Node / package managers
node_modules/
**/node_modules/

# Lockfiles: keep root, ignore nested
**/package-lock.json
**/pnpm-lock.yaml
**/yarn.lock
!/package-lock.json
!/pnpm-lock.yaml
!/yarn.lock
.pnpm-store

### Logs
logs
**/logs
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
lerna-debug.log*

### Build & tooling outputs
dist/
**/dist/
dist-ssr/
build/
**/dist/
**/dist-ssr/
**/build/
.vite/
**/.vite/
coverage/
**/coverage/
*.tsbuildinfo
.turbo/
.cache/
.tmp/
temp/
tmp/
apps/frontend/.vite/
WARP.md

### Environment files
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local
**/.env
**/.env.local
**/.env.*.local
!.env.example
!**/.env.example

### Editors/IDEs
.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json
**/.vscode/*
!**/.vscode/extensions.json
.idea/
*.suo
*.ntvs*
*.njsproj
*.sln
*.sw?

### OS files
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

### Project-specific artifacts
# Backend local data (SQLite, uploads, etc.)
apps/backend/data/
*.db
*.db-*

# Package docs (keep root /docs)
packages/**/docs/

# Old/export helper outputs seen in repo history
all_repo.txt
all_src_code.txt
tree.txt

### Scripts output
scripts/output/
